  "rationale": "Neutral carry of the third-generation candidate D3 (flex_methanol.wsp2, sha256:55e0cb12a5a07321df89210e32f74b5ea668dacefcea3684698d6c9d511f43ce), not a candidate and not to be revised: its numbers are those of D3, typed by the author, unchanged; the entries added by flex_methanol-wsp-v4 (art.min_gated, art.d0_tol, art.rise_tol, art.r_band, art.weight, art.sigma_m, art.sigma_rate_m_s, post.he_w, post.seen_max) are neutral and stay so (no artefact component, no helium term, the third-generation clamp). On the fourth-generation forward it gives the train scores of D3 exactly, and stands in for D3 in paired comparisons with the fourth-generation candidates (same prefix policy). Exposure: that of D3.",
